WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.312
Welcome to AroNexa for dealers. Here's a quick look around.

00:04.312 --> 00:11.717
Requests for quotation come in from pharmacies. Fill in your price, stock and delivery time, and send your quote.

00:11.717 --> 00:18.995
Orders shows the quotes you won. Mark each one dispatched and delivered, and the pharmacy confirms receipt.

00:18.995 --> 00:27.275
Your catalogue lists permitted medicines, consumables and equipment. Choose which ones patients can also buy in the Health Store.

00:27.275 --> 00:37.624
Pharmacies can return stock that is close to expiry. Check the batch, then accept, partly accept or reject. That's it. Now, start exploring.
